# ── Added 2026-08-08 (audit remediation) ─────────────────────────────────────
# Agent worktrees: 7 near-duplicate copies of the whole repo, ~1.3 GB on disk.
# 14,755 of them are already tracked — untracking is a separate, deliberate commit.
.claude/worktrees/
greenstreet_frontend/.claude/worktrees/

# Hand-rolled device-sync archives and git bundles, 291 MB. One `git add -A`
# would weld these into history irreversibly. Never commit them.
_to_delete/
greenstreet_frontend/_to_delete/
*.bundle
*.tar.gz

# graphify content-hash cache — machine-generated, append-only, 1,040 files tracked.
graphify-out/cache/
